msgstr "Nie in staat om maksimum oop lêers te kry."

#: ../duplicity/dup_main.py:1457
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Max open files of %s is too low, should be >= 1024.\n"
"Use 'ulimit -n 1024' or higher to correct.\n"
msgstr ""
"Max oop lêers van %s te laag is, behoort te wees >= 1024.\n"
"Gebruik 'ulimit -n 1024' of hoër om reg te stel.\n"

#: ../duplicity/dup_main.py:1509
msgid ""
"RESTART: The first volume failed to upload before termination.\n"
"         Restart is impossible...starting backup from beginning."
msgstr ""
"HERBEGIN: Die eerste volume kon nie oplaai voor beëindiging nie.\n"
"         Herbegin is onmoontlik...begin rugsteun vanaf begin."

#: ../duplicity/dup_main.py:1515
#, python-format
msgid ""
"RESTART: Volumes %d to %d failed to upload before termination.\n"
"         Restarting backup at volume %d."
msgstr ""
"HERBEGIN: Volumes %d to %d mislukte om oplaai voor beëindiging nie.\n"
"         Herbegin rugsteun by volume %d."

#: ../duplicity/dup_main.py:1522
#, python-format
msgid ""
"RESTART: Impossible backup state: manifest has %d vols, remote has %d vols.\n"
"         Restart is impossible ... duplicity will clean off the last "
"partial\n"
"         backup then restart the backup from the beginning."
msgstr ""
"HERBEGIN: Onmoontlike rugsteun staat: manifes het %d vols, afgeleë het %d "
"vols.\n"
"         Herbegin is onmoontlik ... duplicity sal skoon off die laaste "
"partial\n"
"         rugsteun dan herbegin die rugsteun van die begin af."

#: ../duplicity/dup_main.py:1543
msgid ""
"\n"
"PYTHONOPTIMIZE in the environment causes duplicity to fail to\n"
"recognize its own backups.  Please remove PYTHONOPTIMIZE from\n"
"the environment and rerun the backup.\n"
"\n"
"See https://bugs.launchpad.net/duplicity/+bug/931175\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"PYTHONOPTIMIZE in die omgewing oorsake duplicity te versuim om\n"
"herken sy eie rugsteuns.  Verwyder asseblief PYTHONOPTIMIZE vanaf\n"
"die omgewing en laat die rugsteun weer herloop.\n"
"\n"
"Sien https://bugs.launchpad.net/duplicity/+bug/931175\n"

